    "title": "Toyota",
    "description": "At Toyota, we aim to revolutionize how you can use technology to get the most out of your ownership experience. Stay connected to your vehicle wherever you go, giving you convenience and accessibility with the Toyota app.\r\nLog in or register and unlock the potential of select vehicles (1) with Connected Services such as:\r\nRemotely start/stop your vehicle(2)\r\nLock/Unlock your doors(2)\r\nFind your local Toyota Dealership\r\nSchedule maintenance at your local Toyota dealership\r\n24/7 Roadside assistance,\r\nFind your vehicle's last parked location,\r\nOwner's manual & warranty guides, and more!\r\n \r\nStay connected to your vehicle and start experiencing convenient features available on the Toyota app.\r\n\r\nCompanion Wear OS App provides convenient way to operate Remote Services(1)(2).\r\n \r\n(1) Available services vary by vehicle and subscription type.\r\n(2) Remote services: Be aware of vehicle surroundings. Operate when legal and safe (e.g., do not start the engine in an enclosed space or if occupied by a child). See the Owner's Manual for limitations.\r\n*Features may vary by region, vehicle, and select markets.",
    "descriptionHTML": "At Toyota, we aim to revolutionize how you can use technology to get the most out of your ownership experience. Stay connected to your vehicle wherever you go, giving you convenience and accessibility with the Toyota app.<br>Log in or register and unlock the potential of select vehicles (1) with Connected Services such as:<br>Remotely start/stop your vehicle(2)<br>Lock/Unlock your doors(2)<br>Find your local Toyota Dealership<br>Schedule maintenance at your local Toyota dealership<br>24/7 Roadside assistance,<br>Find your vehicle&#39;s last parked location,<br>Owner&#39;s manual &amp; warranty guides, and more!<br> <br>Stay connected to your vehicle and start experiencing convenient features available on the Toyota app.<br><br>Companion Wear OS App provides convenient way to operate Remote Services(1)(2).<br> <br>(1) Available services vary by vehicle and subscription type.<br>(2) Remote services: Be aware of vehicle surroundings. Operate when legal and safe (e.g., do not start the engine in an enclosed space or if occupied by a child). See the Owner&#39;s Manual for limitations.<br>*Features may vary by region, vehicle, and select markets.",
